truncate(integer) → 0

Truncates file to at most integer bytes. The file must be opened for writing. Not available on all platforms.
f = File.new("out", "w")
f.syswrite("1234567890")   #=> 10
f.truncate(5)              #=> 0
f.close()                  #=> nil
File.size("out")           #=> 5
